                                                  <InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" xml:space="preserve">["Identify the document type, Aadhaar side, Aadhaar number, person name, and person type." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"IMPORTANT RULES:" + vbCrLf +
"- Return ONLY one valid JSON object. No markdown, explanation, or extra text." + vbCrLf +
"- Use the document image for visual decisions. Use OCR only as supporting information." + vbCrLf +
"- Never guess, invent, combine, or modify values." + vbCrLf +
"- Expected document types are only PAN and AADHAAR." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"1. DOCUMENT TYPE:" + vbCrLf +
"- PAN card → ""PAN""" + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar card → ""AADHAAR""" + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"2. AADHAAR SIDE:" + vbCrLf +
"- PAN → documentSide = """"" + vbCrLf +
"- FRONT = main identity side containing the holder's main photograph, name, DOB and/or gender." + vbCrLf +
"- BACK = address/QR-code side without the main identity photograph." + vbCrLf +
"- Address + QR code without the main identity photograph → ""BACK""." + vbCrLf +
"- Main identity photograph → ""FRONT""." + vbCrLf +
"- Do not determine FRONT/BACK from the name, Aadhaar number, or OCR text alone." + vbCrLf +
"- If both sides are visible in the same image → ""FRONT""." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"3. AADHAAR NUMBER:" + vbCrLf +
"- For AADHAAR, extract the complete 12-digit Aadhaar number from the large, clearly printed Aadhaar-number line." + vbCrLf +
"- The primary source is the large printed number, normally shown as three groups of 4 digits." + vbCrLf +
"- ALWAYS prefer the large printed number over small duplicate text near the photograph." + vbCrLf +
"- Remove spaces/separators and return exactly 12 digits." + vbCrLf +
"- All 12 digits must come from the SAME printed Aadhaar-number line." + vbCrLf +
"- NEVER combine digits from different numbers to create 12 digits." + vbCrLf +
"- NEVER append or prepend another number such as 1947." + vbCrLf +
"- Do not use QR-code data, DOB, PIN, address, phone, helpline, issue date, or other unrelated numbers." + vbCrLf +
"- Do not guess, correct, replace, add, remove, or rearrange digits." + vbCrLf +
"- If the large printed 12-digit number is unclear or cannot be reliably read, return """"." + vbCrLf +
"- PAN → adhar = """"" + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"4. PERSON NAME:" + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar FRONT → identify the name from the identity side." + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar BACK → personName = """"." + vbCrLf +
"- Never use the name printed in the BACK address section as the identified person." + vbCrLf +
"- PAN → identify the PAN holder name." + vbCrLf +
"- Match the identified name against Owners, Tenants, Identifiers, and Family." + vbCrLf +
"- Ignore case, punctuation, middle names, and word order when matching names." + vbCrLf +
"- A name with fewer words can match a name with additional middle names if the meaningful name words match." + vbCrLf +
"- Example: ""Gauri Abhishek Kulkarni"" matches ""Gauri Kulkarni""." + vbCrLf +
"- Example: ""Abhishek Balkrishna Kulkarni"" matches ""Abhishek Kulkarni""." + vbCrLf +
"- Example: ""Kulkarni Abhishek"" matches ""Abhishek Balkrishna Kulkarni""." + vbCrLf +
"- Family matching must use the provided Family reference name." + vbCrLf +
"- If the identified document name reliably matches the Family reference name, return the identified document name as personName." + vbCrLf +
"- If there is no reliable match → personName = """"." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"5. PERSON TYPE:" + vbCrLf +
"- Owner match → ""OWNER""" + vbCrLf +
"- Tenant match → ""TENANT""" + vbCrLf +
"- Identifier match → ""IDENTIFIER""" + vbCrLf +
"- Family match → ""FAMILY""" + vbCrLf +
"- No reliable match → ""OTHER""" + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar BACK → personName = """" and personType = ""OTHER""." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"6. FINAL VALIDATION:" + vbCrLf +
"- documentType must be exactly PAN or AADHAAR." + vbCrLf +
"- PAN → documentSide = """", adhar = """"." + vbCrLf +
"- AADHAAR → documentSide must be FRONT or BACK." + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar BACK → personName = """", personType = ""OTHER""." + vbCrLf +
"- Aadhaar number must contain exactly 12 digits when returned." + vbCrLf +
"- Never return an 11-digit or 13-digit Aadhaar number." + vbCrLf +
"- Never create a 12-digit number by combining separate numbers." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"7. INDEX2 RULES:" + vbCrLf +
"- If the document is the New English ""Index -2"", return documentType = ""INDEX2""." + vbCrLf +
"- For INDEX2, documentSide = """" And adhar = """"." + vbCrLf +
"- Extract the owner/licensor name from ""(7) Licensor Name and Address""." + vbCrLf +
"- Return the Licensor/Owner name as personName." + vbCrLf +
"- For INDEX2, personType = """"." + vbCrLf +
"- Do not extract Aadhaar number from INDEX2." + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"FINAL OUTPUT:" + vbCrLf +
"{""documentType"":"""",""documentSide"":"""",""adhar"":"""",""personName"":"""",""personType"":""""}" + vbCrLf +
vbCrLf +
"Owners: " + String.Join(", ", ownerNames) + vbCrLf +
"Tenants: " + String.Join(", ", tenantNames) + vbCrLf +
"Identifiers: " + String.Join(", ", identifierNames) + vbCrLf +
"Family: " + familyName + vbCrLf +
"Relation: " + relation + vbCrLf +
"Document OCR:" + vbCrLf +
digiText]</InArgument>
